   "text": "OnCampus Loughborough (Foundation) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nOnCampus Loughborough (Foundation)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLoughborough University is somewhere anyone can realise their full potential. The atmosphere and team spirit on campus inspire and empower people to achieve extraordinary things. This progressive and ambitious attitude is reflected in the success we achieve, as one of the top-performing universities in the country. Loughborough University is also a welcoming place where staff and students should feel they can be themselves. Across everything we do, we are working together to create a better future, for everyone.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 08:43\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:43\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £22,000.00\nMin: £17,250.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n26%\n4,453 of 17,130 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nOn Campus\nFounded Year\n1909\nCampus(es)\nLoughborough\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n29/03/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.lboro.ac.uk/services/accommodation/on-campus/fees/\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=opItCEdX7t0\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
